From 2c3749f23990696bcdfcad2151c50b475c7a845b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 00:47:06 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Encounters: never place a rare Pokemon in a more common slot

In crowded tables the placement fell back to a 10% slot, which made
Cyndaquil, and at some times of day Chikorita and Kangaskhan, common.
A placement now only takes a slot at most as likely as its class, the
rarest are placed first, and Cyndaquil, Chingling and Seviper move to
Route 37, Sprout Tower and Route 42 where there is room.

tools/hack/encounters.py now has to be run on the data as it was
before the previous commit.
---
 data/Encounters.c        | 84 ++++++++++++++++++++--------------------
 tools/hack/encounters.py | 32 +++++++++------
 2 files changed, 63 insertions(+), 53 deletions(-)

